.TH CHATBRIDGE-GUI 1 "October 2026" "chatbridge 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
chatbridge\-gui \- graphical two-way chat history sync between Cursor and Claude
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chatbridge\-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the ChatBridge window: a list of conversations from Cursor and Claude with their sync state, a detail pane with
Compare and Sync actions, an Activity page with the auto-sync log and Undo for Cursor writes, and an Auto-sync switch.
Requires GTK 4 and libadwaita.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR chatbridge (1)
